      "Type": 0,
      "Language": "javascript",
      "Source": "#!share --from csharp clusterNodes --as nodes\n\nconsole.log(`⚡ Node.js Kernel received ${nodes.length} cluster nodes from C#!`);\n\nconst highLoadNodes = nodes.filter(n => n.CpuPercent > 70);\nconsole.log(`🚨 High Load Nodes (>70% CPU):`);\nhighLoadNodes.forEach(n => console.log(`  - [${n.Region}] ${n.NodeId} (${n.Role}): ${n.CpuPercent}% CPU`));\n\nconst totalLatency = nodes.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n.LatencyMs, 0);\nconst avgLatency = (totalLatency / nodes.length).toFixed(1);\nconsole.log(`\\n⏱️ Aggregated JavaScript SLA Latency: ${avgLatency} ms`);\n\n// Display filtered high-load cluster nodes as interactive table from Node.js\ndisplay(highLoadNodes);",
      "OutputText": "⚡ Node.js Kernel received 6 cluster nodes from C#!\n🚨 High Load Nodes (>70% CPU):\n  - [us-west-2] node-worker-02 (Compute Shard): 78.2% CPU\n  - [sa-east-1] node-cache-05 (Redis In-Memory): 88.9% CPU\n  - [ap-northeast-1] node-ai-06 (Tensor Pipeline): 92.1% CPU\n\n⏱️ Aggregated JavaScript SLA Latency: 33.5 ms\nArray[3]",
      "ExecutionCount": 15,
      "IsExecuting": false,
